items.title:
io.vidocq.runtime:vidocq-runtime-ravel-extension 0.1.1 发布, Opt-in MicroProfile Config 3.1 integration. Plugs Ravel as a ConfigSourceProvider
        for vidocq-runtime-core (replaces the native ConfigSource ServiceLoader when present)
        and brings @ConfigProperty CDI injection via the transitive ravel-cdi-vauban BCE.

